        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kendalia%2C_Texas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "George Wilkins Kendall established a ranch and introduced sheep ranching to the area in the 1840s, shaping its early economy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/kendalia-tx",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Holy Archangels Greek Orthodox Monastery, founded in 1996 by Elder Ephraim of Arizona, sits near Kendalia.",
